{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-5","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与比例与整数","englishTitle":"Plane numbers have to one another the ratio compounded of the ratios of their sides.","book":8,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","contentId":"euclid-8-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"154e09210191ca81db584154514e7b078268ba58d4599a6bf8cb950a50c4f387","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-5.statement","euclid-8-5.construction.1","euclid-8-5.proof.1","euclid-8-5.proof.2","euclid-8-5.proof.3","euclid-8-5.proof.4","euclid-8-5.proof.5","euclid-8-5.proof.6","euclid-8-5.proof.7","euclid-8-5.conclusion","euclid-8-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88beb3a52f10fdc3b850c5c7362fdcf57898218cf050dcbb5ad7247ce6a1e11e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Plane numbers have to one another the ratio compounded of the ratios of their sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平面数之间的比例加在一起,它们之间的比例也比较好。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69c051a06a35827bfe22a04a80997074f5689113b45a489abea3adb8deec1645","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be plane numbers, and let the numbers C, D be the sides of A, and E, F of B; I say that A has to B the ratio compounded of the ratios of the sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A、B和平面数数字,C、D数字为A的两边,B的E、F数字为A;我说,A比B比是双方比的加和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab4403f2e696afd635049769c50fa76475bdae38ba6e0139e32a089713ec441e","citations":["euclid-8-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, the ratios being given which C has to E and D to F, let the least numbers G, H, K that are continuously in the ratios C : E, D : F be taken, so that, as C is to E, so is G to H, and, as D is to F, so is H to K. [[VIII. 4](/principles/euclid-8-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"C对E和D对F的比,而G对H和K的比,则从C对E对D对F的比,到F对F的比,再从C对D对F的比,再到K对K的比,C对E对E的比等于G对H对K的比；C 与 E 之比等于 G 与 H 之比；D 与 F 之比等于 H 与 K 之比。 [[VIII. 4](/principles/euclid-8-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3925aaf95edf56adfc278213d293c4c4538d5bfab0b00df70b29c70bf71f72fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let D by multiplying E make L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D和E的产物 L"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7359de408155aa5aea8dd3e81d67f70012b41eac4f5862c80cc315e852a7044","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since D by multiplying C has made A, and by multiplying E has made L, therefore, as C is to E, so is A to L. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,D乘以C, 已经达到A, E乘以L, C比E等于A比L；C 与 E 之比等于 A 与 L 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0022c402e83ba2a8f708e6541bad9c3f607ff77ff1dc700c5a4c17f5285ec3df","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to E, so is G to H; therefore also, as G is to H, so is A to L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C对E的比等于G对H的比;因此,G对H的比等于A对L的比；C 与 E 之比等于 G 与 H 之比；G 与 H 之比等于 A 与 L 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ecae22801937db4e5a4309e1016c73e1c06ac67a63f39530bdc4d03fa58b0f1a","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since E by multiplying D has made L, and further by multiplying F has made B, therefore, as D is to F, so is L to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自E乘以D后,L成为L,F成为B,因此,D与F的比等于L与B的比；D 与 F 之比等于 L 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75cd70f199ca042cb2627a46bc4c305e21ac72fabb2e7ea6d18735bcf32fe8b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as D is to F, so is H to K; therefore also, as H is to K, so is L to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,D对F的比等于H对K的比;因此,H对K的比等于L对B的比；D 与 F 之比等于 H 与 K 之比；H 与 K 之比等于 L 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ecde1dec7d940a581561b61c77fe841299df1164b686db9ee0e5a556801e57e7","citations":["euclid-7-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as G is to H, so is A to L; therefore, ex aequali, as G is to K, so is A to B. [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,G对H的比等于A对L的比;因此,从平等角度看,G对K的比等于A对B的比；G 与 H 之比等于 A 与 L 之比；G 与 K 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e98f2e2c93ece359bd3df8f868407156bfe83f37e465ce5c69c7d67336569c71","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But G has to K the ratio compounded of the ratios of the sides; therefore A also has to B the ratio compounded of the ratios of the sides. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但G比K比双方比加起来;因此,A比B比双方比加起来。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-5.source","contentId":"euclid-8-5","revisionId":"euclid-8-5@raw-154e09210191ca81","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"961e01916bb8e3378af9740cd513b7d5f6b71ceeead1de721b35a99fa6a829e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-5:euclid-8-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-5.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-8-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"VIII. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-5:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-5.proof.3","euclid-8-5.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-5:euclid-7-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-5.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.pe